---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About Micro Signal Cosmos" description="Who runs this, how articles are made, and how the business works." canonical="https://microsignalcosmos.com/about/">
  <div class="container-narrow py-12 sm:py-16">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-display font-extrabold tracking-tight text-text-primary">About Micro Signal Cosmos</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lead text-text-secondary">Independent technical publication exploring systems engineering, AI/ML, and astrophysics through deep-dive guides and reproducible architectures.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">Who Runs This</h2>
      <div class="prose-editorial max-w-none">
        <p><strong>Micro Signal Cosmos is a solo project</strong> — one person using AI research and drafting tools to explore, draft, and structure technical articles, then verifying and editing everything before publishing.</p>
        <p>I don't claim decades of hyperscale engineering experience. I'm someone who enjoys learning complex technical topics deeply and wanted to create the kind of resource I wish existed when I was learning: thorough, well-sourced, practical explanations of complex systems — browser internals, LLM architectures, database internals, fusion physics, and more.</p>
        <p>Every article is researched using primary sources (papers, RFCs, official docs, source code), drafted with AI assistance, then verified by me: code is executed, math is checked, configs are tested. If I can't verify it, it doesn't publish.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">How Articles Are Made</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b-2 border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700">
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold">Step</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold">Process</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold">Tools</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-neutral-100 dark:border-neutral-800">
              <td class="p-3 font-medium">Topic Selection</td>
              <td class="p-3">Chosen based on reader questions, architecture gaps, and emerging technologies</td>
              <td class="p-3">Editorial judgment</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-neutral-100 dark:border-neutral-800">
              <td class="p-3 font-medium">Research</td>
              <td class="p-3">Primary sources: arXiv, official docs, source code, GitHub issues, RFCs</td>
              <td class="p-3">Academic databases, RFC specifications, source repositories</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-neutral-100 dark:border-neutral-800">
              <td class="p-3 font-medium">Drafting</td>
              <td class="p-3">Structured outline &rarr; AI-assisted drafting with research assistance &rarr; human verification &amp; editing</td>
              <td class="p-3">AI research assistance + manual verification</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-neutral-100 dark:border-neutral-800">
              <td class="p-3 font-medium">Verification</td>
              <td class="p-3">Run ALL code, check ALL math, validate ALL configs, test commands</td>
              <td class="p-3">Local execution, compiler explorer, test suites</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-neutral-100 dark:border-neutral-800">
              <td class="p-3 font-medium">Editing</td>
              <td class="p-3">Structure, clarity, tone, formatting, citation formatting</td>
              <td class="p-3">Manual review and editorial style guides</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-neutral-100 dark:border-neutral-800">
              <td class="p-3 font-medium">Fact-Check</td>
              <td class="p-3">Every claim traced to primary source (linked in article)</td>
              <td class="p-3">Manual verification against sources</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium">Publish</td>
              <td class="p-3">Astro build &rarr; Cloudflare Pages deploy</td>
              <td class="p-3">Git push &rarr; auto-deploy</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="prose-editorial max-w-none mt-6">
        <p><strong>Quality gate:</strong> Every article is verified by a human before publication. Code is executed, math is checked, configurations are tested. AI assists with research and drafting; human verifies everything. If I can't verify it, it doesn't publish.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">Content Philosophy</h2>
      <div class="prose-editorial max-w-none">
        <h3 class="text-h3 font-bold mb-3">What you'll find here:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Primary sources</strong> — every claim links to a paper, spec, doc, or repo</li>
          <li><strong>Runnable code</strong> — snippets you can copy-paste and execute</li>
          <li><strong>Decision frameworks</strong> — not "use X," but "choose X when Y, Z when W"</li>
          <li><strong>No fluff</strong> — if a section doesn't teach, it's cut</li>
        </ul>
        <h3 class="text-h3 font-bold mt-6 mb-3">What you won't find:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Press release rewrites</li>
          <li>"Top 10" lists without technical depth</li>
          <li>Opinion pieces disguised as analysis</li>
          <li>Content I haven't verified</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">Categories</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-6 dark:border-neutral-700 dark:bg-neutral-900/50"><h3 class="font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">Technology</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Browser internals, CPU architecture, WebAssembly, networking, systems</p></div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-6 dark:border-neutral-700 dark:bg-neutral-900/50"><h3 class="font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">AI &amp; ML</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">LLM training/inference, RAG, evaluation, tooling, workflows</p></div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-6 dark:border-neutral-700 dark:bg-neutral-900/50"><h3 class="font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">Science</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Astrophysics, fusion, particle physics, scientific method</p></div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-6 dark:border-neutral-700 dark:bg-neutral-900/50"><h3 class="font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">Developer Tools</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Databases, caching, search, observability, self-hosting, CLI</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Editorial Focus Areas Section -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">Editorial Focus Areas</h2>
      <p class="text-text-secondary mb-6">Articles are organized through three editorial focus areas, each representing a domain for consistent depth and perspective.</p>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-6 dark:border-neutral-700 dark:bg-neutral-900/50">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">Systems &amp; Infrastructure</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary">Browser internals, CPU architecture, WebAssembly, networking, TLS/PKI, self-hosted infrastructure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-6 dark:border-neutral-700 dark:bg-neutral-900/50">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">AI &amp; Machine Learning</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary">LLM training/inference economics, RAG systems, model evaluation, transformer architecture, AI tooling.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-6 dark:border-neutral-700 dark:bg-neutral-900/50">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">Science &amp; Physics</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary">Stellar spectroscopy, exoplanet atmospheres, dark matter, nuclear fusion, observational cosmology.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">Business Model</h2>
      <div class="prose-editorial max-w-none">
        <p>I'm transparent because hidden incentives erode trust.</p>
        <table class="w-full border-collapse mb-6">
          <thead><tr class="border-b-2 border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700"><th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold">Revenue Stream</th><th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold">Status</th><th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold">How It Works</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-neutral-100 dark:border-neutral-800"><td class="p-3 font-medium">Display ads</td><td class="p-3">Inactive by default</td><td class="p-3">Configurable placement containers designed without layout shifts</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-neutral-100 dark:border-neutral-800"><td class="p-3 font-medium">Affiliate links</td><td class="p-3">Active</td><td class="p-3">Hosting, cloud, databases, security tools. Only products I use. Marked with ★</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-neutral-100 dark:border-neutral-800"><td class="p-3 font-medium">Digital products</td><td class="p-3">Building</td><td class="p-3">Technical guides, checklists, reference templates, code repositories</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-neutral-100 dark:border-neutral-800"><td class="p-3 font-medium">Newsletter sponsorships</td><td class="p-3">Planned</td><td class="p-3">Relevant technical tools aligned with audience interests</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="p-3 font-medium">Courses/cohorts</td><td class="p-3">Future</td><td class="p-3">Deep-dive technical workshops</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p><strong>Affiliate rule:</strong> I only link products I've personally used in production or tested extensively. If I wouldn't recommend it to a colleague, it's not linked.</p>
        <p><strong>No sponsored content</strong> — if a sponsor ever collaborates on placement, it is prominently labeled and never influences technical accuracy.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">Newsletter: The Weekly Signal</h2>
      <div class="prose-editorial max-w-none">
        <p><strong>Free, weekly, no spam.</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>3–5 technical articles worth your time</li>
          <li>One technical concept explained simply</li>
          <li>One tool or workflow I'm using in production</li>
          <li>Zero tracking pixels, zero third-party data sharing</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">Corrections &amp; Feedback</h2>
      <div class="prose-editorial max-w-none">
        <p><strong>If I got something wrong, tell me.</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Contact Form: <a href="/contact/" class="text-brand-primary underline">Contact Desk</a></li>
          <li>Email: <a href="mailto:admin@microsignalcosmos.com" class="text-brand-primary underline">admin@microsignalcosmos.com</a></li>
          <li>GitHub Issues: <a href="https://github.com/Akm4033/micro-signal-cosmos/issues" class="text-brand-primary underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/Akm4033/micro-signal-cosmos/issues</a></li>
          <li>Response time: Usually within 24 to 48 hours</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Corrections are transparently appended to articles with timestamps and precise errata notes. No silent edits.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">Contact</h2>
      <div class="prose-editorial max-w-none">
        <ul>
          <li>Inquiries: <a href="/contact/" class="text-brand-primary underline">Contact Form</a></li>
          <li>Direct Email: <a href="mailto:admin@microsignalcosmos.com" class="text-brand-primary underline">admin@microsignalcosmos.com</a></li>
          <li>GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/Akm4033/micro-signal-cosmos" class="text-brand-primary underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/Akm4033/micro-signal-cosmos</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
